1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,509
I left before dawn

2
00:00:01,509 --> 00:00:05,358
wondering why I'd dragged myself out into the cold.

3
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:09,950
Then the first light caught the peaks.

4
00:00:09,950 --> 00:00:13,486
Some moments just don't fit inside a photograph.

5
00:00:14,150 --> 00:00:16,314
But the trail got rough.

6
00:00:16,314 --> 00:00:17,576
My legs ached.

7
00:00:17,576 --> 00:00:18,568
For a while

8
00:00:18,568 --> 00:00:21,182
I really wanted to turn back.

9
00:00:22,150 --> 00:00:24,581
An old man on the path told me

10
00:00:24,581 --> 00:00:26,445
'Don't rush to the top.

11
00:00:26,445 --> 00:00:27,742
Take your time.'

12
00:00:30,150 --> 00:00:32,529
So I put my phone away.

13
00:00:32,529 --> 00:00:33,356
Cowbells

14
00:00:33,356 --> 00:00:33,770
wind

15
00:00:33,770 --> 00:00:35,528
bread and cheese.

16
00:00:35,528 --> 00:00:36,252
Somehow

17
00:00:36,252 --> 00:00:37,700
it was enough.

18
00:00:38,150 --> 00:00:40,079
Then the clouds lifted.

19
00:00:40,079 --> 00:00:42,343
The whole valley opened up.

20
00:00:42,343 --> 00:00:43,852
I just stood there

21
00:00:43,852 --> 00:00:45,110
saying nothing.

22
00:00:46,150 --> 00:00:47,841
The hard part passed.

23
00:00:47,841 --> 00:00:48,807
From up here

24
00:00:48,807 --> 00:00:52,270
the things I'd worried about felt so small.

25
00:00:53,150 --> 00:00:53,747
By dusk

26
00:00:53,747 --> 00:00:56,649
the village lights felt like home.

27
00:00:56,649 --> 00:00:59,294
What I'd found was my own pace.